* hematopoietic stem cell transplant (HSCT) within two years or ongoing immunosuppressive therapy;
* high-dose systemic corticosteroids (≥20 mg of prednisone/day or equivalent for ≥2 weeks);
* alkylating agents (e.g., cyclophosphamide) or antimetabolites such as methotrexate (\>0.4 mg/kg/week), azathioprine (≥3 mg/kg/day), or 6-mercaptopurine (≥1.5 mg/kg/day);
* chemotherapy agents for cancer;
