主要终点:
Incidence and severity of adverse events and serious adverse events

This study specifies that the recording of adverse events begins on Day 0 (D0). Adverse events (AEs) include, but are not limited to, the following:

1. Worsening of pre-existing medical conditions/diseases (i.e., conditions present prior to enrollment in the clinical trial), including exacerbation of symptoms, signs, frequency of episodes, or abnormal laboratory test results;
2. Any newly occurring adverse medical conditions (including symptoms, signs, or newly diagnosed diseases);
3. Abnormal laboratory test values or results with clinical significance, or other safety assessments (e.g., vital signs measurements).

