5. Previous malignant tumors that require treatment or have evidence of recurrence within the 5-year period prior to the first study medication \[excluding basal cell carcinoma of the skin and the following in situ cancers: squamous cell carcinoma, bladder in situ carcinoma, endometrial in situ carcinoma, cervical in situ carcinoma/atypical hyperplasia, prostate cancer incidentally discovered histologically (TNM staging T1a or T1b), or breast in situ carcinoma\];
