* 10\. The main organs function are normally, the following criteria are met: (1) Blood routine examination criteria should be met (no blood transfusion and blood products within 14 days, no correction by G-CSF and other hematopoietic stimuli): HB≥90 g/L; ANC ≥ 1.5×10\^9/L; PLT ≥80×10\^9/L; (2) Biochemical examinations must meet the following criteria: TBIL\ 60 ml/min (Cockcroft-Gault formula).

Exclusion Criteria:

