14. Those who test positive in the infectious disease screening during the screening period (including hepatitis B surface antigen (HBsAg), hepatitis C virus antibody, human immunodeficiency virus antibody, and syphilis antibody);
15. Those who have received a vaccination within 1 month before screening or plan to receive a vaccination during the trial or within 1 month after dosing;
